  "name": "bulk-bg-remove",
  "description": "Remove image backgrounds locally and in bulk: one photo, a folder (searched recursively) or many folders, with BiRefNet and lighter models picked to fit the machine. No uploads, no API keys, no per-image cost. Writes lossless transparent PNG/WebP, or shop-ready photos (white or any colour, square, sized, JPEG), to a new \"<name>-no-bg\" folder next to the input and never touches the originals. Use when the user asks to remove, cut out or erase a background, make a transparent PNG, isolate a product, person, animal or object, prepare product or catalog photos, or replace remove.bg for a batch. Reads JPG, PNG, HEIC, WebP, AVIF, TIFF and BMP.",
